{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "0d014e678008f4792b306221e7f19f2fccec9200a1f8cc6970cab75db2a7edf1", "ja": "やっぱりあの荷物を開けられるのは、\n{$P$}さんだけ……！", "zh": "果然能打开那个包裹的，\n只有{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "3bbaa109076c8b2c16d5936fef77a6598655e8c731c24a9790a397fcfac69b85", "ja": "うう、早く来てくれないかな～！\nあの荷物の中には、一体何が……！？", "zh": "呜呜，能不能快点来呀～！\n那个行李里面到底有什么……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "69921528c33f0a08bb8cf0530a43481ccdf6a319b864b80df50248b4ba5cbcc1", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n近頃は暖かくなってきて……。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n最近天气也渐渐暖和起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "a6556068a9c3e71085f9afa36e87fa1fcaab9f7788af22e12494cfccd24187f1", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nすっごく、すっごく待ってましたっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我等了好久、好久了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7272103d5200414acf2e203afa99601eeb23594c901da6ce90936a67c6bcfa09", "ja": "待ってた……？　あの、打ち合わせの\n予定とか入ってましたっけ……？", "zh": "等着我……？那个，我们之前有安排商谈之类的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ea8cb48e1cfaccad5a1435f2253d354672cd1a941f60f9efa056b64d04ccf245", "ja": "違うんです！　この荷物を開けてもらえますか？\n次のシーズンに関わる、重要な資料なんです！", "zh": "不是这样的！能帮我把这件行李打开吗？这是关系到下一季的重要资料！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e96ecec1151b85afb6576c239f574284662e509a6ac525892cf9eac5f36168db", "ja": "この荷物が……？　確かに送り主が\n社長になってますね……どれ。", "zh": "这份包裹……？寄件人确实写着社长……我看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1007_se", "source_sha256": "9bce5ea25b46290e58b299d481d59b5ee3a9ccd01b47dd1e087537381f0678e3", "ja": "パカッ", "zh": "啪嗒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "41409ff00424cb8dfc7cd052a53af27f7cab063a99bfabac46ffd1b9a0af61c0", "ja": "な、中身は……！　………………ゲームソフト？\n懐かしい感じのものがたくさん……。", "zh": "里、里面是……！　………………游戏软件？\n好多让人怀念的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8e392a109f1522207c359d1f0af15fbf3040fc74d3f0079f8a95beec05eb6c8e", "ja": "……でも、肝心のものが入っていませんね。\n社長に電話して、確認を取らないと。", "zh": "……不过，最重要的东西不在里面呢。\n得给社长打个电话确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1010_se", "source_sha256": "978b67b487d7874229876fc151ceb1caea5461cfc40baf64f421bb8d1ed3e94c", "ja": "プルルル……", "zh": "嘟嘟嘟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "2126aebe3ba87b7a14971cd87df2e062b91df6f2414afb2b55166e47f7227c7d", "ja": "「やあ、君か！　今ちょっと手が離せない状態で……\nあっ、音無君！　次は私の番だよ！」", "zh": "“哎呀，是你啊！我手头刚好有点脱不开身……\n啊，音无君！接下来轮到我了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f8ff01c0aae50f803c5b55fc435e52939318986012b21041b08b9602edd06bc1", "ja": "荷物は受け取りました。ただ……ゲームソフトだけで、\n肝心のゲーム機本体が入っていないようですが。", "zh": "行李我已经收到了。只是……里面好像只有游戏软件，\n并没有装最重要的游戏机本体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "f37c66e8b07b21f848ef97493881d03436696abcd23841e1c82c28e95d66bfae", "ja": "「おお、その件か！　本体はこちらにあるんだが……\nすぐ取りに来てくれたまえ！　待っているよ！」", "zh": "「哦，是那件事啊！本体是在我这里……\n你赶快过来拿吧！我等着你！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "358a4351146b8c4ec74d961ac95ce3bb400cc9ed6806fe1d87b37b8d098fe1af", "ja": "あっ、社長！　……すみません、\n今からちょっと事務所に行ってきますね！", "zh": "啊，社长！……不好意思，\n我现在去一趟事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "7dcebb9c3dc8c512e99e5dc17cd3c18cebefcf181be852d2781a8ac674966f1d", "ja": "わかりました！　このレトロゲーム達は、\n私が慎重に保管しておきますね～！", "zh": "好的！这些怀旧游戏，\n我会小心谨慎地保管好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1016_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "f02097d0f9654fcfc3bc47389129da5c0f58d804ced8c788ef2b49407945fbf3", "ja": "社長！　上に穴を掘るんです！\nその岩を落として、敵を潰す感じで……！", "zh": "社长！要往上面挖洞！\n把那块岩石砸下去，把敌人压扁……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "2ce32deabb8a0ab13ba89a3ed648a804534ff34cda1407d07c074e7dfff613b0", "ja": "任せたまえ！　こう見えて若い頃はブイブイ\n言わせて……おや、画面が暗くなったが……？", "zh": "交给我吧！别看我这样，年轻时可是风光无限……哎呀，画面怎么变暗了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "3e2aeea7b1872d0e5abc1d3ead687d460a5466930a649a11ae83c3337fee8c73", "ja": "本体を揺らしたから、ゲームが落ちたんですね。\n接触が悪いようなら端子に息を吹きかけて……。", "zh": "因为把主机晃动了，所以游戏闪退了吧。\n如果是接触不良，就对着接口吹口气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8ed67bdf3ba17810ab2721c06e555f1425150fa6bf171340e7d3ae5fa2d5d91b", "ja": "……。どうしてゲーム機本体だけ\n送られてこないのかと思ったら……。", "zh": "……我还在想，为什么唯独游戏机本体没有被送过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "2463299913633267f4195d6ab170f4b8f2ada8745998bac9dfca66c4287ca6de", "ja": "む、君か！　いやあ、すまんすまん！\nつい白熱してしまってね……。", "zh": "嗯，是你啊！哎呀，抱歉抱歉！\n一不小心就上头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "cabad3e26c472789b052ebe96382f437e0b18082aa37f16e30e85b21755e275b", "ja": "思わず夢中になっちゃう魅力がありますよね～。\nあっ、ただ遊んでいたわけじゃないんですよ？", "zh": "确实有让人不知不觉就沉浸其中的魅力呢～。\n啊，我可不是只顾着玩哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "d052b3e793c1fbd009d46e34a9a12f34846d06a8a2571640165752dece998091", "ja": "うむ！　これはミリオンシアターシーズン、\nLOVERS HEART新曲の資料だからね！", "zh": "嗯！这是Million Theater Season、LOVERS HEART新歌的资料哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "779f4fda2da254f6e6f97af62b2778a33c798a277fe46b4d6a580264408d3e60", "ja": "おお……！　ダイヤ、クローバーに続いて、\nいよいよハートチームが始動ですね！", "zh": "哦……！继方块和梅花之后，终于轮到红心队伍启动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "ba876fcbe3b770d81b91ebede3cf8532167cbae8422221ab31ad80a273a34152", "ja": "うむ！　君もこのサンプルを聞けば、\n資料の意図は理解してくれることだろう！　ポチッと！", "zh": "嗯！只要你也听了这个试听样本，\n想必就能理解资料的意图了吧！按下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c48135ea05f956d89ea820996d5df422aae02b7a0d13f047ec027c0165120c4e", "ja": "なるほど、チップチューン！　懐かしさと\n切なさの同居する、いいサウンドです……！", "zh": "原来是芯片音乐！怀旧与伤感交织其中，真是美妙的音色……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "b5ebbe8f4ea93005f7764321805cbc758f192408d09fc1cbccbffe4d6c5c3750", "ja": "歌詞もかわいらしいですよね～。\n思わずハートがキュンキュンしちゃいます……♪", "zh": "歌词也很可爱呢～。\n让人忍不住心动不已……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "fa079805bbfb7dfa8fa4a5ebb955790fe386d457571574d9cac8095a3625db13", "ja": "確かにこの曲を理解するには、レトロゲームは\n必要な資料ですね。さすがは社長です！", "zh": "确实，要理解这首曲子，复古游戏是必不可少的参考资料呢。不愧是社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "7c2ab8f01e626a7d6ca6128eecb590b6e3a859b476bfdcf2f03552dfe92b40cf", "ja": "そうだろうそうだろう！　ということで、\nどうだね。君もひとつ……。", "zh": "就是这样，就是这样！所以说，怎么样？你也来一个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "a7220be3cf7f29362ff923a92d0031cb62f3dfc703ac91339ff493e5ebcee542", "ja": "はい。では、遠慮なく本体はもらっていきますね。\nアイドルのみんなにプレイしてもらいたいので。", "zh": "好的。那么，我就不客气地收下本体了。\n因为我想让偶像们都玩玩看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "31a9c5ca9216961722c0e435cdebb9a0437e1c17eb54c7239952a2e13cdc49a8", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、私のプレイが\n途中なので、続きを……！", "zh": "诶！？不是，我还没玩完，接下来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "e487dcd8a4ff16118478fa522e60615bb5d1885b7601d506525c0091a35c3c77", "ja": "私も、次こそ社長のハイスコアを更新出来そう\nなんです！　あと一機！　あと一機だけ～！", "zh": "我也觉得这次一定能刷新社长的最高分！再一条命！就再一条～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "72cc838d8e721848dfab9730c96992dd3da9e16ffa6dea0669572726a3d8e2ec", "ja": "（LOVERS HEARTが始動……胸が高鳴るな！\nさっそくミーティングの準備をしないと！）", "zh": "（LOVERS HEART正式启动……真让人心潮澎湃！得赶紧准备会议了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
